Subject: [PATCH 3/8] 10.6 full-build base: WTF/JSC/WebCore/WebKitLegacy
 SDK-compat guards (all frameworks link clean)

---
 .../jit/ExecutableAllocator.cpp               |  4 +++
 Source/WTF/wtf/cocoa/FileSystemCocoa.mm       |  1 +
 Source/WTF/wtf/cocoa/ResourceUsageCocoa.cpp   |  1 +
 Source/WTF/wtf/mac/FileSystemMac.mm           |  2 ++
 Source/WTF/wtf/posix/OSAllocatorPOSIX.cpp     |  2 +-
 .../accessibility/mac/AXObjectCacheMac.mm     |  5 +++
 .../graphics/cg/GraphicsContextCG.cpp         |  8 +++--
 .../platform/graphics/cocoa/IOSurface.mm      | 13 +++++++
 .../WebCore/platform/mac/ScrollbarThemeMac.mm |  5 +++
 .../network/cocoa/ResourceRequestCocoa.mm     |  1 +
